  "transcript": "Claude just killed video editors. 🤯 You can now edit any video you want using Claude Code and it takes 3 steps to set up. 1. Open the Claude desktop app and select Code 2. Google Remotion, copy the code, paste it into Claude and hit Enter 3. Open a new tab, go to /remotion-video and tell Claude exactly what you want to edit Claude opens its own video editor and starts editing based on your instructions. Want a revision? Just ask and it updates instantly. This is genuinely one of the craziest things I’ve seen Claude do. #ai #claude #claudecode #videoediting #remotion",
